00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:14.601
Ready for your review. Not sent.

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:21.596
Commercial. Residential. EV. Less chasing. More building.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.899
OfficeAdmin with AIVA. Built for contractors.

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:29.140
Run the work. Not the runaround.
